---
source: crates/pixi_manifest/src/toml/workspace.rs
expression: "expect_parse_failure(r#\"\n        [workspace]\n        channels = []\n        platforms = []\n\n        [workspace.multichannels]\n        defaults = [\"https://repo.anaconda.com/pkgs/main\"]\n        \"#,)"
---
  × the `multichannels` table requires the 'multichannels' preview flag
   ╭─[pixi.toml:6:9]
 5 │
 6 │ ╭─▶         [workspace.multichannels]
 7 │ ╰─▶         defaults = ["https://repo.anaconda.com/pkgs/main"]
 8 │
   ╰────
  help: Run `pixi workspace preview add multichannels` to enable the preview flag
